<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Industrial Gases 6-mth profit up.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Industrial Gases 6-mth profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month profit for Industrial Gases Nigeria Plc to end-March 1997. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				   1997	    1996</p>
<p> Turnover			 224    vs    180</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	67    vs     46</p>
<p> Taxation			  22    vs     15</p>
